  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 803.10 Criteria for Acceptance of In-Lieu Mitigation Payments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 803.10 Criteria for Acceptance of In-Lieu Mitigation Payments. An in-lieu mitigation payment shall not substitute for the requirement to avoid or minimize impacts established in Env-Wt 313.03.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Wt 803) #11000, eff 2-1-16; ss by #12808, eff 12-15-19 (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 800); ss by #13774, eff 10-13-24",
